&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;Scale&lt;/strong&gt;, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, Ernst &amp;amp; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., the Government of Qatar, and U.S. government agencies including the Army and Air Force.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scale&#39;s Machine Learning Research team builds the foundation for the next generation of AI systems — pushing the boundaries of what&#39;s possible with frontier models while ensuring safety, reliability, and alignment at every step. Our work spans generative AI, reinforcement learning and advanced post-training methods, scalable oversight, synthetic data pipelines, red teaming, and evaluation science.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are developing a large-scale hybrid human-machine system to power machine learning pipelines for dozens of industry-leading customers. These models and systems form the backbone of Scale&#39;s long-term strategy, enabling billions of tasks monthly and supporting some of the most complex and advanced use cases in the AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you&#39;ll work on a combination of deeply technical ML applications in production and cutting-edge research problems, with mentorship from world-class researchers and the opportunity to collaborate with leading teams across industry and academia. Interns own real, published or shipped work — not side projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example Projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the dangerous capabilities of frontier models and conduct preparedness research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research the science and creation of new benchmarks for frontier models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new methods for training models to excel on extremely difficult reasoning problems that require long chains of thought&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research reinforcement learning and post-training methods that improve model reliability on high-stakes tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research scalable oversight protocols that enable humans to produce and quality control reasoning chains beyond their native capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study the boundaries of model generalization and capabilities to inform data-driven advancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research synthetic and hybrid data with humans in the loop to scale up high-quality data generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take models currently in production, identify areas for improvement, improve them using retraining and hyperparameter searches, then deploy without regressing on core model characteristics&lt;/li&gt;
